# bail-processing-algorithms

Core logic for automating bail processing and eligibility verification.

## Automated Bail Status Lookup
Workflow for processing and normalizing bail information:
- Ingests raw bail status data from inmate lookup systems
- Normalizes bond amounts and types
- Verifies eligibility based on jurisdiction rules
- Maintains audit trail of lookups and determinations

## Bail Eligibility Rules Engine
- Bond type classification (cash, surety, personal recognizance)
- Jurisdiction-specific validation rules
- Multi-step eligibility verification process
- Integration with inmate status verification

## Fast-Path Bail Processing
Optimized workflow for common bail scenarios:
- Pre-validated bond templates
- Automated eligibility pre-screening
- Quick-path processing for standard bond types
- Exception handling for non-standard cases

